 },
 "rule": [
  "Schemas are copied from $defs with $ref rewritten to #/schemas/<name>.",
  "Annotation keywords are removed: description, title, format, default, examples, minimum, maximum, discriminator, $schema and every x- keyword. A property named title stays.",
  "allOf is merged into the schema that holds it: properties and required are joined, so each union variant is one closed object. A lone allOf member is replaced by that member; const is rewritten as a one-member enum, and a oneOf of string consts as one enum.",
  "A property the adapter neither writes nor reads keeps its name with the empty schema {}, so its graph stays out.",
  "SessionUpdate keeps agent_message_chunk, agent_thought_chunk, tool_call, tool_call_update and available_commands_update; ContentBlock keeps text; ToolCallContent keeps content and diff; McpServer keeps stdio.",
  "JSONRPCRequest, JSONRPCNotification, JSONRPCResponse and JSONRPCError are the JSON-RPC 2.0 envelopes ACP names as its base; the schema file types only their params and results."
 ],
 "omitted": [
  "ContentBlock.audio",
  "ContentBlock.image",
  "ContentBlock.resource",
  "ContentBlock.resource_link",
  "McpServer.acp",
